<div class="flex flex-col gap-12"><div class="hide-empty" data-module-id="69b03231d5d2ddc996460f26" data-module-key="main-block-0" data-item-position="2"><article class="prose w-full max-w-4xl rounded-md bg-white"><div data-testid="article-header"><div class="align-center flex items-center justify-between pb-4" data-testid="article-header-top-row"><div data-testid="article-category-container"><!-- -1 children --></div></div><h1 class="tracking-tight text-gray-900 flatplan_header m-0 py-2 text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-extrabold lg:text-4xl" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_header" data-testid="article-headline">Rain Delays Qualifying For The Indy 500</h1><h2 class="text-lg leading-loose tracking-normal text-gray-900 flatplan_intro m-0 py-2 font-medium" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_intro" data-testid="article-subheadline">Qualifying for the Indianapolis 500 was rained out Saturday and was pushed back to Sunday.</h2><div class="flex items-center pt-2 pb-4" data-testid="authors-container"><div class="inline" data-testid="author-text-container"><!-- -4 children --></div></div><div class="mt-2 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><button class="cursor-pointer items-center px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-500 rounded-lg border border-[#676767] bg-transparent flex" data-testid="view-comments-button"><!-- -1 children --></button><div class="flex items-center justify-between" data-testid="share-container"><!-- -1 children --></div></div></div><div class="flatplan_body" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_body"><div><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><!-- -2 children --></figure><p><!-- -1 children --></p><p>The first round of qualifying for the 110th Indianapolis 500 was rained out Saturday, leading to a busy, condensed schedule on Sunday.</p><p>Storms and showers rained out practice on Saturday morning and kept coming into the afternoon, forcing IndyCar to push all qualifying to Sunday.</p><div class="flex items-center">
        
      <!-- -1 children --></div><p><!-- -1 children --></p><p>Qualifying will begin at noon on Sunday, and each driver will only get one try at qualifying for the Fast 12 and a second qualifying session. More on this procedure can be found . <!-- -1 children --></p><p>Fortunately for IndyCar, Sunday's activities at Indianapolis Motor Speedway won't be rained out. Forecasters are calling for a dry, warm and mostly sunny day on Sunday.</p><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><!-- -1 children --></figure><p>The green flag will drop on the iconic race at 12:45 p.m. on May 24.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6" id="comments-section"><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-6 min-h-[60px]"><!-- -2 children --></div><div class="relative"><!-- -2 children --></div></div></div></article></div><!-- Taboola sponsored content feed hidden --><div data-item-id="~~V1~~2265226761846821573~~PHUZjKRIjhuVhh3xOHWcoQ" data-item-title="Magnitude 6.0 Earthquake Shakes All Hawaiian Islands" data-item-thumb="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/hawaii-earthquake-052326.avif" data-item-syndicated="false" class="videoCube trc_spotlight_item origin-default textItem thumbnail_top videoCube_1_child trc-first-recommendation trc-spotlight-first-recommendation trc_excludable"><a target="_parent" class="item-thumbnail-href" href="https://weather.com/2026/05/23/news/weather/strong-earthquake-shakes-hawaiian-islands" slot="thumbnail"><div class="thumbBlock_holder"><span role="img" aria-label="Image for Taboola Advertising Unit" class="thumbBlock" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://images.taboola.com/taboola/image/fetch/f_jpg%2Cq_auto%2Ch_267%2Cw_480%2Cc_fill%2Cg_faces:auto%2Ce_sharpen/https%3A//s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/hawaii-earthquake-052326.avif&quot;);"><span class="thumbnail-overlay"></span></span><div class="videoCube_aspect"></div></div></a><a title="Magnitude 6.0 Earthquake Shakes All Hawaiian Islands" target="_parent" class="item-label-href" href="https://weather.com/